{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっふーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は祝日でしたね。\nみなさん今日なにをしましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはちょっとお仕事\nちょっとお買い物しやした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無印良品でシャツ買って\n古着屋でスカート買いました。\n相変わらず中途半端なスカート丈だ！\nどっちも白！春！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後久しぶりに「Colorful」観た。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わりゃ、こりゃすりーでいーめがねだ\nぷーいぷーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかもうすぐバレンタイン\nじゃないですかあ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ、メンバーの手作りチョコ\n美味しそうだったなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼かなりん／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいクッキーありがと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ！ラッピングやカップは大量に\n買ったのにまだチョコを買ってない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日買うぞ。\n何チョコ作ろうかなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかゆるんでるなあ\n気を引き締めろ！自分！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまとまってない\n短文更新でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/11/9012921/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}